{"ts":"2026-10-10T08:06:36.457Z","type":"agent_event","event":{"type":"content_end","contentType":"reasoning","reasoning":"The scaffold looks complete with Next 16 and Tailwind via turbopack, and the commit step finished successfully. I notice the layout uses Geist from next/font/google, which could fail to build offline since it needs network access to download fonts—I should check on that.\n\nNow I need to copy files over with robocopy, excluding .git and node_modules, and write my own README rather than copying the scaffold's version, while keeping AGENTS.md since it'll regenerate anyway. For npm install, since it'll likely exceed the 30s timeout, I'll run it in the background with Start-Process and poll for completion.\n\nThe scaffold finished and committed successfully; as expected, Next 16.4 uses `@tailwindcss/turbopack` instead of PostCSS, so no config file was generated. I'll now copy everything except `.git`, `node_modules`, and the template README into the project, then kick off `npm install` in the background since it exceeds the tool timeout.\n\n"}}
