{"ts":"2026-10-10T08:06:51.774Z","type":"agent_event","event":{"type":"content_end","contentType":"reasoning","reasoning":"Robocopy's exit code 3 confirms the copy succeeded with extras, so that's fine. Now I need to update package.json with the right name and scripts, then run the install — since npm install could take longer than 30 seconds, I'll launch it in the background with Start-Process and poll for completion. I'll keep the Next 16.4 scaffold as generated, including whatever Tailwind/turbopack config it produced, rather than fighting it.\n\nFor dependencies, I'll add vitest, fast-check, and zod directly into package.json with the versions noted earlier (vitest 5.0.3, fast-check 4.10.2, zod 4.6.5) as caret ranges, then run one combined npm install in the background rather than multiple separate calls.\n\nThe copy succeeded. Now I'll update package.json (name, scripts, zod, vitest, fast-check) and kick off npm install in the background to avoid the tool timeout.\n\n"}}
